<title>USA: U.S. Sept bonds inch up to Friday's high of 112-02.</title>
<headline>U.S. Sept bonds inch up to Friday's high of 112-02.</headline>
<text>
<p>June 16 - U.S. September T-bonds inched up to Friday's high of 112-02/32 on light volume. Resistance is at 112-06/32 and at 112-11/32, a two-thirds retracement level from contract's six-month downmove. Further resistance rests at 113-01/32.</p>
<p>Traders said locals covered short positions.</p>
